(7784432, 1295669, 3306, '<td valign="top">
I have to critique this honestly because I am a golfer!! Unfortunately, I see several flaws :(. The first thing is that the ball is tee''d up in high grass which cannot be the T box. Does the title of the picture intimate that the player is cheating? The challenge stipulates the appearance of action. It looks like the club is resting on the ground or on a metal plate and the top is out of focus. The grass is oversaturated. the top of the ball is overexposed. Sorry, it''s just not realistic to me. 5. Don''t feel too badly, it will probably get a better score than my entry! I hope you take my critique in a positive and constructive way.</td>', 'I have to critique this honestly because I am a golfer!! Unfortunately, I see several flaws :(. The first thing is that the ball is tee''d up in high grass which cannot be the T box. Does the title of the picture intimate that the player is cheating? The challenge stipulates the appearance of action. It looks like the club is resting on the ground or on a metal plate and the top is out of focus. The grass is oversaturated. the top of the ball is overexposed. Sorry, it''s just not realistic to me. 5. Don''t feel too badly, it will probably get a better score than my entry! I hope you take my critique in a positive and constructive way.', '2025-07-13 22:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
