(7784468, 1295660, 122678, '<td valign="top">
Congratulations, your image was my 10 for this challenge. An incredible image (and yes I am a baseball fan) the placement of the players is perfect, the B/W contrast has an old time feel to it and I love the  use of the netting which can be very distracting but not here, it has become part of the design and it is straightened perfectly leaving the players at the right angle. Perfect baseball shot! Amazing photography!!!</td>', 'Congratulations, your image was my 10 for this challenge. An incredible image (and yes I am a baseball fan) the placement of the players is perfect, the B/W contrast has an old time feel to it and I love the  use of the netting which can be very distracting but not here, it has become part of the design and it is straightened perfectly leaving the players at the right angle. Perfect baseball shot! Amazing photography!!!', '2025-07-14 11:40:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7784469, 1295597, 122678, '<td valign="top">
